  "summary": "Vendored qs library parse implementation (qs/lib/parse). It splits a query string by delimiter (respecting parameterLimit, ignoreQueryPrefix and utf8 charset sentinels), decodes keys/values with the configured decoder, handles comma lists, interpretNumericEntities and [] suffixes, then expands bracket/dot keys into nested objects/arrays up to depth and arrayLimit while guarding prototype keys. Results are merged and compacted with qs utils (module 398).",
